  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGarments2Look\n\t\n\n\nPaper: Garments2Look: A Multi-Reference Dataset for High-Fidelity Outfit-Level Virtual Try-On with Clothing and Accessories\nAuthors: Junyao Hu, Zhongwei Cheng, Waikeung Wong, Xingxing Zou\n\n\nPaper: arXiv, CVPR, \u4e2d\u8bd1\u7248\nProject Page\nPoster\nDataset\nComparison Results on Test Set\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAbstract\n\t\n\nVirtual try-on (VTON) has advanced single-garment visualization, yet real-world fashion centers on full outfits with multiple garments, accessories, fine-grained\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ArtmeScienceLab/Garments2Look.",
